1
00:02:30,601 --> 00:02:35,186
<v Agent>Hello, Elite Travel, this is Emily speaking, how may I assist you today?


2
00:02:35,186 --> 00:02:42,324
<v Customer>Hi, I have a group visit to plan, and I wonder whether you could help me decide on which hotel to book. 


3
00:02:42,324 --> 00:02:48,608
<v Customer>I have narrowed it down to either the Winchester, the Royal Hotel, or the Star Hotel.

4
00:02:48,608 --> 00:02:51,548
<v Customer>I am wondering if you have a recommendation.


5
00:02:51,387 --> 00:02:55,639
<v Agent>I would be happy to help! Those three are excellent choices.

6
00:02:55,639 --> 00:03:00,909
<v Agent>If everyone is booking hotel rooms independently, an easy way to do it is online booking. 

7
00:03:00,909 --> 00:03:04,933
<v Agent>The Star Hotel offers online booking at no additional charge.


8
00:03:04,933 --> 00:03:06,499
<v Customer>It sounds fine!


9
00:03:06,499 --> 00:03:11,452
<v Agent>Yeah, and you can even book the gorgeous sea view rooms if you act quickly.


10
00:03:11,452 --> 00:03:13,727
<v Customer>Hm, I will consider that.

11
00:03:13,727 --> 00:03:20,478
<v Customer>It would be great since we are mostly first-time visitors to the area to get a nice view of the water.

12
00:03:20,478 --> 00:03:24,201
<v Customer>Now, are there handicap accessible rooms?


13
00:03:24,201 --> 00:03:28,146
<v Agent>Yes, all three options have access for the physically disabled.

14
00:03:28,146 --> 00:03:36,170
<v Customer>Great. I should also mention that we will be on a tight schedule, so we won’t have much time to go out for meals.

15
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:38,961
<v Customer>Which of these hotels serve food?

16
00:03:38,961 --> 00:03:44,410
<v Agent>There is a limited continental breakfast menu at the Star and at the Winchester. 

17
00:03:44,410 --> 00:03:48,346
<v Agent>For a full restaurant and room service, the Royal Hotel is your best bet.


18
00:03:48,346 --> 00:03:51,787
<v Customer>Oh wonderful! Could you tell me more about the restaurant?


19
00:03:51,787 --> 00:04:01,101
<v Agent>Absolutely. In the morning there is a gourmet buffet or a la carte item, and after 11 a.m. lunch is served in the dining room. 

20
00:04:01,101 --> 00:04:09,701
<v Agent>Dinners are in a nice, low-key but high quality setting in the hotel’s private dining room and Fridays feature the house jazz band.


21
00:04:09,701 --> 00:04:14,215
<v Customer>How lovely! Is there a group discount?


22
00:04:14,215 --> 00:04:18,804
<v Agent>No, sorry. Not at the Royal hotel. Let me check on the others, though.

23
00:04:18,804 --> 00:04:21,264
<v Agent>Could I place you on hold for just a second?


24
00:04:21,264 --> 00:04:22,733
<v Customer>Sure, thanks.


25
00:04:22,733 --> 00:04:29,279
<v Agent>It looks like there is one at the Winchester - 15% off when you book 8 or more rooms.


26
00:04:29,279 --> 00:04:33,582
<v Customer>Really? Sold! We’ll book at the Winchester. 

27
00:04:33,582 --> 00:04:36,863
<v Customer>Wait - is it suitable for children though?

28
00:04:36,863 --> 00:04:42,704
<v Customer>We’ll have a few little ones in our group, and it would be great to have a way to keep them occupied.


29
00:04:42,704 --> 00:04:49,118
<v Agent>Yes. In fact, it has a play place that kids just love, with slides, and swings and everything.

30
00:04:49,118 --> 00:04:51,813
<v Agent>Definitely a good hotel to bring the kids.


31
00:04:51,813 --> 00:04:53,629
<v Customer>Okay, great.


32
00:05:29,122 --> 00:05:32,635
<v Customer>So now I know where we'll be staying, what next? 

33
00:05:32,635 --> 00:05:36,965
<v Customer>Should I go ahead and book transportation and assign rooms and everything?


34
00:05:36,965 --> 00:05:40,860
<v Agent>Well, for now, there are only a few things for you to take care of.

35
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:44,960
<v Agent>We will hold a block of rooms for you as soon as you send a deposit.

36
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:51,548
<v Agent>I recommend booking as soon as possible, so you know how many rooms to hold.


37
00:05:51,548 --> 00:05:57,513
<v Customer>Oh, right. Okay, I’ll send the invitations and put down the deposit. 

38
00:05:57,513 --> 00:06:00,096
<v Customer>Is there anything else I should take care of?


39
00:06:00,096 --> 00:06:09,249
<v Agent>Great! And don’t worry about this now, but sometime before you arrive do let us know if you’ll be requiring our transport service to and from the airport.


40
00:06:09,249 --> 00:06:13,217
<v Customer>I’ll make sure to let you know. Does that incur a service charge?

41
00:06:13,217 --> 00:06:19,332
<v Customer>Or perhaps a tip, or some presents to show our gratitude for the personal car service?


42
00:06:19,332 --> 00:06:28,107
<v Agent>Oh, don’t worry about it. It is a free service, so if you would like to tip you are welcome to do, but hotel drivers do not accept gifts


43
00:06:28,107 --> 00:06:29,377
<v Customer>Thanks for your help!


44
00:06:29,377 --> 00:06:32,388
<v Agent>My pleasure. Enjoy your stay at the Winchester!